#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:13
#: 81b6683f749b41acbbb094310308cdc0
msgid "GPS/Compass"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:15
#: c5b80d97202e463383f94d0f17f3571d
msgid "GPS is usually mandatory in plane,copter,and rover vehicles, except when some other position determining :ref:`sensor or system is used <common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page>`. Sub does not use GPS. Compass is also usually required for Copter, Rover, Sub, and QuadPlane types of Plane (see :ref:`common-compassless` for compass alternatives), but not for Conventional Planes, however it is recommended."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:17
#: 1326675d4f5a42378b324105723bd954
msgid "Some Copter and Rover modes can operate without GPS and Compass (see vehicle documentation for its flight modes)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:19
#: 27bfb46a752d4a5bbff6990b13abf333
msgid "Multiple GPS and/or Compasses can be used in the system, see :ref:`common-gps-blending`, :ref:`common-compass-setup-advanced`, and :ref:`common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching` for more information"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:24
#: fcd299a7fa4e4187bab5dd32a545eeac
msgid "TX and RX are swapped from autopilot to GPS module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:26
#: 22c9f6bff22e4a0faec3e051b69a2259
msgid "Usually GPS is attached to the logical Serial Port 3 by default in ArduPilot. However, which  physical UART is assigned to ArduPilot's Serial Port 3 on the autopilot is documented in the autopilots :ref:`documentation <common-autopilots>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:28
#: 7299fe5fa57a4fecb06801b325bb1d00
msgid "It is important that a GPS be connected to the first SERIALx port that has its ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` parameter set to \"5\" (GPS) since it will stop searching for GPS during boot-up if not found on the first port configured for GPS protocol."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:31
#: b7ec89b4b43f4ee081294e5f31780a07
msgid "As a wiring example, the topic :ref:`3DR UBlox GPS + Compass Module <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` shows how to connect to a Pixhawk autopilot and includes additional configuration and mounting information."
msgstr ""

